1
00:00:56,759 --> 00:00:57,560
Dawei.

2
00:00:58,240 --> 00:01:00,039
We've been together for three years.

3
00:01:00,479 --> 00:01:04,439
Didn't you always want me before?

4
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:08,599
Even in this new life,

5
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,760
you still do this.

6
00:01:13,799 --> 00:01:16,480
I can give myself to you today.

7
00:01:17,519 --> 00:01:18,560
But...

8
00:01:18,799 --> 00:01:21,000
You have to promise to do something for me.

9
00:01:21,239 --> 00:01:22,959
You have to promise to do something for me.

10
00:01:33,319 --> 00:01:35,159
Just how big of a favor is this?

11
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:37,680
Didn't you say only on our wedding day

12
00:01:37,719 --> 00:01:39,359
would you finally give yourself to me?

13
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:44,920
I'm giving you that chance right now!

14
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:47,480
Dawei,

15
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:48,640
listen to me.

16
00:01:49,239 --> 00:01:51,599
I got a chance for a promotion.

17
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,400
As long as you take that 100,000

18
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,719
and deliver it to Director Liu,

19
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:58,239
I can become President Zhao's Executive Secretary

20
00:01:58,439 --> 00:02:00,040
and fulfill my white-collar dream.

21
00:02:03,159 --> 00:02:04,040
Dawei,

22
00:02:04,239 --> 00:02:06,079
you wouldn't refuse to help me,

23
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:07,239
would you?

24
00:02:08,159 --> 00:02:10,280
In my past life, hearing the same words,

25
00:02:10,759 --> 00:02:12,400
I agreed without hesitation,

26
00:02:13,159 --> 00:02:15,560
only to get three years in prison,

27
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:19,319
and be ruthlessly dumped by you.

28
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:28,800
Qianqian...

29
00:02:31,719 --> 00:02:32,479
"Ma Dawei,

30
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:34,240
if you had any self-awareness,

31
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,520
you'd understand

32
00:02:36,039 --> 00:02:36,879
that right now,

33
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:38,879
you don't deserve me at all."

34
00:02:39,439 --> 00:02:41,439
I admit I was completely blind back then

35
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,080
and ruined my whole life.

36
00:02:43,719 --> 00:02:44,439
Thank God,

37
00:02:44,919 --> 00:02:46,599
I've been reborn!

38
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:51,520
Bribery is no small matter.

39
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,120
What if I told you

40
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:54,439
that delivering the money for you

41
00:02:54,639 --> 00:02:55,759
would land me in prison?

42
00:02:59,199 --> 00:03:00,400
Everyone else gives gifts.

43
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:01,960
Why would only you go to jail?

44
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:03,319
You just don't want to help me!

45
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:04,879
Who am I doing this for?

46
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,560
Isn't it all for our future?

47
00:03:09,479 --> 00:03:10,879
If you don't want to deliver it,

48
00:03:11,199 --> 00:03:12,000
then let's break up!

49
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:12,960
Fine.

50
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:15,120
Let's break up.

51
00:03:16,879 --> 00:03:17,599
Ma Dawei,

52
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,280
do you even know what you're saying?

53
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:23,199
I said,

54
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:24,479
we're breaking up!

55
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:30,360
Ma Dawei,

56
00:03:30,919 --> 00:03:32,120
you're the one letting me down!

57
00:03:32,879 --> 00:03:34,120
Don't you dare regret this!

58
00:03:34,319 --> 00:03:36,360
Whoever regrets it is a dog!

59
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:37,599
You...!

60
00:03:54,479 --> 00:03:55,479
I'm so sorry, Special Assistant Wei.

61
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:55,879
I...

62
00:03:55,879 --> 00:03:58,240
You swore to me yourself

63
00:03:58,439 --> 00:03:59,400
that you could pull this off!

64
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:01,280
I already told President Zhao!

65
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:02,439
Now you can't even handle

66
00:04:02,439 --> 00:04:04,159
that broke boyfriend of yours!

67
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,120
How am I supposed to save face?

68
00:04:06,599 --> 00:04:07,800
I'm sorry, Special Assistant Wei.

69
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:09,840
I had no idea he'd refuse!

70
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:10,639
Screw you!

71
00:04:12,319 --> 00:04:13,719
Special Assistant Wei, let me explain!

72
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:14,599
Please, let me explain!

73
00:04:14,919 --> 00:04:15,800
Just let me explain!

74
00:04:23,879 --> 00:04:24,879
In my previous life,

75
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,399
because of those three years in prison,

76
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:28,959
I lived in abject poverty,

77
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:30,879
and my family was ruined.

78
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:32,399
Now that I'm reborn,

79
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:35,399
I, Ma Dawei, will make up for every regret

80
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:37,160
and become a true

81
00:04:37,519 --> 00:04:39,279
winner in life!

82
00:04:44,519 --> 00:04:45,920
What kind of lousy clothes are these?

83
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:47,680
The fabric's as rough as sandpaper!

84
00:04:47,839 --> 00:04:49,519
Wearing it could scrape your skin raw!

85
00:04:49,759 --> 00:04:50,639
Refund!

86
00:04:50,639 --> 00:04:51,439
Ma'am...

87
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:52,800
The fabric of these clothes

88
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:54,600
is 100% high-count long-staple cotton!

89
00:04:54,879 --> 00:04:55,560
People in the neighborhood

90
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,839
have worn them for years.

91
00:04:56,959 --> 00:04:57,959
You should all know this!

92
00:04:58,279 --> 00:04:59,759
This fabric is durable.

93
00:04:59,759 --> 00:05:00,879
It can last for ten years!

94
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:03,199
Who wears clothes for ten years?!

95
00:05:03,199 --> 00:05:04,120
Exactly!

96
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:05,000
Hurry up and give our money back!

97
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,120
Clothes from the south nowadays

98
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:07,560
are soft and fashionable!

99
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:08,040
Right!

100
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:10,839
You're still selling these tacky styles?

101
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:11,759
Give us our money back!

102
00:05:11,759 --> 00:05:12,360
Wait, listen...

103
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:12,959
Refund our money now!

104
00:05:12,959 --> 00:05:14,399
Take them home and try them, you'll see!

105
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,600
Rest assured, they're great to wear!

106
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,680
Cut the crap! Just give us a refund!

107
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:17,319
Refund!

108
00:05:17,319 --> 00:05:18,040
We don't want it! Give us our money back!

109
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:18,560
Hurry up! Hurry!

110
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,279
Refund! Money back!

111
00:05:19,279 --> 00:05:19,759
All right, all right!

112
00:05:19,759 --> 00:05:21,839
I'll refund you! I'll give your money back!

113
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:25,800
Give me the clothes.

114
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:27,879
Dong Nan.

115
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:29,560
In my past life, after leaving prison,

116
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:32,360
everyone avoided me like the plague.

117
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:34,120
Only Dong Nan kept helping me,

118
00:05:34,399 --> 00:05:35,639
willing to give me a job,

119
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:38,079
and helped me earn my first pot of gold.

120
00:05:38,519 --> 00:05:39,439
In this life,

121
00:05:39,639 --> 00:05:41,079
I must repay her kindness.

122
00:05:42,639 --> 00:05:43,360
Uncle Dong.

123
00:05:46,079 --> 00:05:46,839
Dawei, you're here!

124
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,160
Your dad told me

125
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:49,560
he wanted you to work here.

126
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:50,920
Ma Dawei!

127
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,120
How dare you show your face here?

128
00:05:53,759 --> 00:05:54,600
You shameless scumbag!

129
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,639
Get the hell out!

130
00:05:55,639 --> 00:05:56,879
You're not welcome in our shop!

131
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:57,839
Get out of here!

132
00:05:58,079 --> 00:05:58,800
Scram!

133
00:06:01,079 --> 00:06:01,959
Vice Director Dong,

134
00:06:02,399 --> 00:06:03,600
who lit your fuse?

135
00:06:03,839 --> 00:06:04,879
Don't play dumb with me!

136
00:06:04,879 --> 00:06:06,399
Qianqian was so devoted to you!

137
00:06:06,839 --> 00:06:07,680
When your family had trouble,

138
00:06:07,680 --> 00:06:09,120
she stood by you through thick and thin!

139
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:09,959
And what about you?

140
00:06:10,199 --> 00:06:12,680
Since she wouldn't sleep with you first,

141
00:06:12,879 --> 00:06:13,480
you...

142
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:14,800
you refused to help her!

143
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:16,319
You even tried to force yourself on her!

144
00:06:18,120 --> 00:06:19,480
You're an absolute monster!

145
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:20,079
An animal!

146
00:06:20,879 --> 00:06:22,680
Scum! Utter scum!

147
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:23,680
Vice Director Dong,

148
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,600
get the facts straight before cursing me?

149
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:26,720
Dad!

150
00:06:27,199 --> 00:06:28,720
Our factory must never

151
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:31,199
take in such an immoral scoundrel!

152
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,079
If word gets out,

153
00:06:32,079 --> 00:06:33,519
what happens to our factory's reputation?

154
00:06:33,959 --> 00:06:34,839
Calm down and talk nicely.

155
00:06:34,839 --> 00:06:35,800
Don't yell!

156
00:06:36,079 --> 00:06:37,720
Still that same rotten temper.

157
00:06:39,199 --> 00:06:41,079
In my past life, I went to prison because of Zhou Qian.

158
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:42,439
It hasn't happened yet in this life,

159
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,480
so she wouldn't believe me anyway.

160
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:44,160
Dad!

161
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:44,680
Forget it.

162
00:06:45,759 --> 00:06:46,199
Look at him!

163
00:06:46,199 --> 00:06:47,000
Vice Director Dong,

164
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:49,120
instead of wasting time playing hero,

165
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,920
why not worry about your factory's clothes?

166
00:06:51,079 --> 00:06:52,600
That lady made a good point earlier.

167
00:06:52,959 --> 00:06:55,120
Uncle Dong's clothes really need updating.

168
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:56,160
What the hell do you know?

169
00:06:56,399 --> 00:06:58,759
Our fabric is the best in the city!

170
00:06:58,759 --> 00:06:59,800
It can last ten years!

171
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,319
People used to be poor.

172
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,600
Buying new clothes wasn't easy.

173
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:04,439
Mending and patching for three more years.

174
00:07:04,439 --> 00:07:06,319
Now, folks are living better lives.

175
00:07:06,319 --> 00:07:08,600
They buy clothes to look good and trendy.

176
00:07:08,759 --> 00:07:09,800
That's a good thing.

177
00:07:09,879 --> 00:07:11,519
It means you can sell more clothes too.

178
00:07:11,519 --> 00:07:12,519
Doing business...

179
00:07:12,519 --> 00:07:13,720
you have to cater to human nature.

180
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:15,120
People always crave what's new.

181
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,680
That's what consumer goods are all about.

182
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:18,079
You make a lot of sense.

183
00:07:18,399 --> 00:07:19,480
Then tell me,

184
00:07:19,639 --> 00:07:21,000
how should we redesign these clothes?

185
00:07:23,839 --> 00:07:24,639
Mind if I borrow this?

186
00:07:27,279 --> 00:07:28,240
Who would've thought?

187
00:07:28,279 --> 00:07:31,120
My prison sewing skills from my past life

188
00:07:31,319 --> 00:07:32,959
actually came in handy today.

189
00:07:36,279 --> 00:07:36,959
Dad!

190
00:07:43,879 --> 00:07:44,399
Uncle Dong,

191
00:07:44,959 --> 00:07:46,519
minor tweaks won't save this factory.

192
00:07:46,879 --> 00:07:47,399
Take a look.

193
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:51,399
This is a modern, low-cut casual blazer.

194
00:07:55,439 --> 00:07:55,920
Look at this!

195
00:07:56,439 --> 00:07:57,639
The shoulders are completely exposed!

196
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:58,879
With a neckline this low,

197
00:07:58,879 --> 00:08:00,040
won't she reveal too much?

198
00:08:00,279 --> 00:08:02,079
What dirty thoughts are in your head?

199
00:08:02,439 --> 00:08:05,160
This style will go national in a year.

200
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:07,759
Every young girl on the streets will own one.

201
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,279
You're just stuck in the past.

202
00:08:09,519 --> 00:08:11,680
Look at posters of Hong Kong, China and Taiwan, China stars

203
00:08:11,839 --> 00:08:12,639
and foreign films everywhere!

204
00:08:12,639 --> 00:08:14,000
Aren't the clothes getting shorter

205
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,040
and more form-fitting?

206
00:08:15,279 --> 00:08:16,680
People might talk smack,

207
00:08:16,759 --> 00:08:18,120
but deep down, they all think

208
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:19,439
it's stylish and attractive.

209
00:08:19,839 --> 00:08:21,240
That's what a fashion trend is.

210
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:22,680
If we want to go global,

211
00:08:22,759 --> 00:08:24,040
we've got to think long-term.

212
00:08:24,519 --> 00:08:26,120
If we get a chance at foreign trade,

213
00:08:26,399 --> 00:08:27,639
we can even earn US dollars!

214
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:28,439
Bah!

215
00:08:28,759 --> 00:08:29,240
Get out of here!

216
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:30,079
We don't need you lecturing us!

217
00:08:30,079 --> 00:08:31,560
I actually find it quite interesting.

218
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:32,759
Dad!

219
00:08:33,039 --> 00:08:34,559
He knows nothing about clothes!

220
00:08:35,639 --> 00:08:36,120
Uncle Dong,

221
00:08:36,279 --> 00:08:37,000
as long as you get it, that's enough.

222
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,320
You should be able to see

223
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:40,120
if we make this in light cotton and linen,

224
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,399
how high the profit margins will be.

225
00:08:41,559 --> 00:08:42,720
Dawei, let's go.

226
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:44,399
Let's talk in my office.

227
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:45,080
Dad!

228
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,639
Go pour Dawei a glass of water, now.

229
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:48,799
I want to have a proper talk with him.

230
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:50,519
Let's go.

231
00:08:54,799 --> 00:08:55,679
Go get the water!

232
00:09:02,559 --> 00:09:04,679
Things are settled with Uncle Dong.

233
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:07,759
Once I make this money,

234
00:09:09,039 --> 00:09:10,240
Dad and Sister-in-law

235
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:11,919
won't have to work so hard.

236
00:09:11,919 --> 00:09:13,279
It's just that the process is a bit slow.

237
00:09:14,399 --> 00:09:17,039
I need to figure out a way to make money fast.
